---
title: "contract_redeployment (Legion: Incident Response Plan)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: fix implemented after incident
    q_init --> q_submit_audit: submit contracts to partner auditing company
    q_submit_audit --> q_audit_review: auditor reviews changes
    q_audit_review --> q_audit_pass: audit passed, no issues
    q_audit_review --> q_audit_fail: audit found issues
    q_audit_fail --> q_fix: fix audit findings
    q_fix --> q_submit_audit: resubmit for audit
    q_audit_pass --> q_deploy_aws: deploy via automated AWS pipeline
    q_deploy_aws --> q_verify_deployment: verify contract deployment
    q_verify_deployment --> q_resume: resume frontend
    q_resume --> q_enable_monitoring: re-enable OZ Defender monitoring
    q_enable_monitoring --> [*]: protocol fully operational

    note right of q_submit_audit
        INV-001: No deployment without passing audit from partner company
    end note

    note right of q_deploy_aws
        INV-002: Deployment is automated through AWS infrastructure
        INV-003: New contract instance deployed (not upgrade of existing)
    end note

    note right of q_enable_monitoring
        INV-004: Monitoring must be active on new contract addresses
    end note
